# Kimbia Mobile Environment Configuration Example
# Local development against local Spring Boot backend:
# Leaving EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL commented out automatically auto-detects your local backend across:
# - Web (http://localhost:8081)
# - Expo Go / Physical Devices (dynamic host IP from Metro connection)
# - Android Emulator (http://10.0.2.2:8081)
#
# Or set an explicit local IP:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8081

# Production / Remote builds:
# EAS builds automatically inject the production URL via eas.json.
# To force local dev to use remote Render backend, set:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_FORCE_REMOTE=true
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://kimbia-backend.onrender.com
